From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Myghi63 <myghi63@disroot.org>
Date: Wed, 04 Nov 2026 21:26:04 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] cc: Build armv9-2a without SVE

SoCs like sm8735 implement armv9.2-a but do not expose SVE to userspace, so
code vectorized for it crashes. Keep the rest of the architecture and turn
SVE off, and enable crypto since these CPUs have it.
---
diff --git a/cc/config/arm64_device.go b/cc/config/arm64_device.go
index d877b65f8..c808222ea 100644
--- a/cc/config/arm64_device.go
+++ b/cc/config/arm64_device.go
@@ -41,7 +41,7 @@ var (
 		"armv8-5a":           {"-march=armv8.5-a"},
 		"armv8-7a":           {"-march=armv8.7-a"},
 		"armv9-a":            {"-march=armv9-a"},
-		"armv9-2a":           {"-march=armv9.2-a"},
+		"armv9-2a":           {"-march=armv9.2-a+crypto+nosve"},
 		"armv9-3a":           {"-march=armv9.3-a"},
 		"armv9-4a":           {"-march=armv9.4-a"},
 	}
